 "paragraphs": [
  "They returned inside the cave and Aliya announced, “There are 341 flowers.”",
  "The young falcon looked at the shells and twigs in front of him and said, “If we add the 58 from before, we have a total of 399.”",
  "The bats cheered, “Correct. You now have the password. Walk through the field of flowers until you meet the wolf.”"
